  "description": "A tiny, dependency-free adaptive polling scheduler. Learns each resource's change cadence with an EWMA estimator and a multiplicative backoff/ramp controller (the same feedback ideas behind TCP RTT estimation and congestion control), so hot resources are polled often and cold ones are polled rarely - without push notifications or webhooks.",
